flowchart TD
    E[User goal / Invoice event] --> G[Gemini 3.6 Flash]
    G -->|tool call| A[Google ADK Agent]
    A --> P[Proposed Action]
    P --> Z[AgentProof Orchestrator]
    Z --> GR[Authorization Grant - short-lived, action-bound]
    GR --> F[Freshness + Action Binding at Dispatch Seam]
    F -->|blocked| B[BLOCKED Receipt]
    F -->|pass| X[Atomic Idempotent Payment Adapter]
    X -->|same execution key| D[DUPLICATE Receipt]
    X --> O[External / Simulated Ledger]
    O --> V[Outcome Verifier]
    V -->|expected state absent| U[UNVERIFIED Receipt]
    V -->|state transition proven| S[VERIFIED Evidence Receipt]
    B --> R[Evidence timeline + canonical SHA-256 digest]
    D --> R
    U --> R
    S --> R
    R --> AU[Audit / Observability]